{"id":"vod_sn_36302","vodId":"36302","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"我太太是高中生","name_cn":"我太太是高中生","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第13集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/88740d7b85aa740c3fa78c7b3948975e.jpg"},"summary":"市丸恭介（真殿光昭 配音）是一个外表和内心都十分朴素的青年，目前就职于一所高中担任物理老师的职务。虽然个性有些木讷害羞，每天都过着两点一线的枯燥生活，但是恭介在教员和学生之间却有着意外高昂的人气。其实，恭介有着一个天大的秘密，他不仅已经结婚，并且，其结婚的对象，居然是在同一学校就读的女子高中生小野原麻美（川澄绫子 配音）！　　17岁的麻美和恭介的感情十分要好。在学校里，她是他的学生，一回到家，她便是他的娇妻。为了遵循父亲的意愿，在同学面前，麻美和恭介必须严格保守着他们的秘密。可是，世上没有不透风的墙壁，还是有一些人察觉到了两人不寻常的关系。两人的命运和爱情会怎样呢？恭介能够平安的等到属于麻美的毕业季的到来吗？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5yMSBrRgSq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JZVpzyuYkp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kcbCKyjgfp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fqsiLuMFdE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NsH4azMQJP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1ctbuv00Lr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5HCtjz7x1f1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PLT7EsdUZ11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y4AFghVEav1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ek8VHD1TtD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9xB9uFquv41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A4LbteyWrP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MFN9LAUMRY1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:24.516Z"}